{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You're lost in a vast forest \u2014 but your partner is firing flares to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.poster.avif?t=1753120213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.webm?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.mp4?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alert \u2014 it\u2019s easy to get lost in the vast woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you'll face many challenges \u2014 the cold and the Wendigo are waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.poster.avif?t=1753120213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.webm?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.mp4?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire is your only friend \u2014 and the Wendigo's enemy. Stay warm and keep your torch lit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/1d2177f03261b67ff99e39bdf437535f.poster.avif?t=1753120213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/1d2177f03261b67ff99e39bdf437535f.webm?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/1d2177f03261b67ff99e39bdf437535f.mp4?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your torch goes out, stay quiet\u2026 or he'll hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.poster.avif?t=1753120213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.webm?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.mp4?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Too long without heat, and the cold kills you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Out here, there are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.poster.avif?t=1753120213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.webm?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.mp4?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15\u201360 minutes (or longer, if you struggle to survive).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No save points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reacts to real-life microphone input.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May contain jumpscares.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2791720?t=1753120213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753120213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/f0a04b34a7d716654a7623061d23eedd3f7592ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753120213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/f0a04b34a7d716654a7623061d23eedd3f7592ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753120213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You're lost in a vast forest \u2014 but your partner is firing flares to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.poster.avif?t=1753120213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.webm?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.mp4?t=1753120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alert \u2014 it\u2019s easy to get lost in the vast woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way,